  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Heat the olive oil in the Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the shrimp and cook until pink, about 2-3 minutes per side.",
    "Add the mussels and crab meat, and cook until the mussels open, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Stir in the smoked paprika, lemon juice, chicken broth, saffron threads, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the feta cheese until melted and well combined.",
    "Transfer the Dutch oven to the preheated oven and bake for 10 minutes.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for a few minutes before serving."
